NOTICE OF THE FISCAL YEAR 2027 BUDGET PUBLIC HEARING  
A Public Hearing for the Spanish Fork City Fiscal Year 2027 Budget will be held before the Spanish Fork City Council on June 2nd, 2026 at 6:00 P.M. This hearing is to receive public comment for the following items:
 1) The proposed Budget for Fiscal Year 2027
Revenues, expenditures, and transfers for all funds;
Donations in the form of cash and fee waivers;
All fees and utility rates schedule; 
This will be held in the Spanish Fork City Council Chambers at 6 pm located at 80 S Main Street, Spanish Fork, Utah. All interested residents are invited to attend.
If you need special accommodation to participate in the meeting please contact the City Manager's office, 801-804-4530.
This was published on the Utah Public Notice Website, the City Website, and posted at the Parks and Recreation, Library Hall, and City Hall buildings by the City Recorder on 05-26-2026
